  "type": "Invariant",
  "fields": {
    "statement": "Each of the Mapper's per-model-type delegate builders (BuildInMapDelegate, BuildOutSetDelegate, BuildOutGetDelegate, BuildReaderMapDelegate) must discover at least one usable mapping while traversing the model type's properties, including mappings found inside a nested MapToModel-decorated property at any depth; the input-parameter builder (BuildInMapDelegate) additionally counts a CollectionMapAttributeBase-decorated property as a usable mapping, while the output-parameter and reader builders do not. A builder that completes its traversal without finding any usable mapping throws NoMappingAttributesFoundException instead of compiling and caching a no-op delegate.",
    "scope": "Mapper's BuildInMapDelegate, BuildOutSetDelegate, BuildOutGetDelegate and BuildReaderMapDelegate (ArgentSea.Shared/src/Mapping/Mapper.cs)"
  },
